                                "sense_id": "e30ce2a1-a4e8-35de-afb4-26fda9c5e7de",
                                "text": "Four miles to the east of Warmington, the River Cherwell flows into Cropredy under a bridge that in 1644 was the scene of another Civil War battle - with an equally indeterminate result."
